@chapter Installation

  Zebra is in development stage, so there is no release in the past.
Zebra's development snapshot can be found at
@url{ftp://ftp.zebra.org/pub/zebra/}.  Once it is released it will be
found at GNU FTP archives.

  Zebra installation is very easy by configure script.  But before you
install Zebra please confirm kernel configuration of your machine.

@menu
