@node   Sample Configuration,  , Basic configuration, Configuration File
@comment  node-name,  next,  previous,  up
@section Sample Configuration

Below is sample configuration of zebra daemon.

@example
!
! Zebra configuration file
!
hostname Router
password zebra
enable password zebra
!
log stdout
@end example

'!' and '#' are comment character.  If the first character of the word
is one of comment character, from the character to the end of line is
ignored as comment.

@example
password zebra!password
@end example

If comment character is not the first character of the word, it's a
normal character. So above '!' doesn't regard as comment and password is
set to 'zebra!password'.


